<section class="cs__sec" aria-labelledby="s1">
  <p class="st-k rv">01 · Challenge</p>
  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s1">A store full of products, and no one to style them</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    Apex sells footwear and lifestyle products online, one product page at a time. A shop assistant
    in a store would help a customer put a look together. Online, that help was missing.
  </p>
  <div class="st-grid st-g3 st-wide">
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Question 01</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">What goes together?</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">Customers choose shoes, bags and clothing separately and match them on their own.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Question 02</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">What suits me?</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">A product photo cannot show how a colour or style will look on the person buying it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Question 03</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">What fits the occasion?</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">An office day, a wedding or a trip each call for a different look.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="st-callout rv">
    <p class="st-bh">
      How might we give every customer a personal stylist, inside the store they already use, that
      ends in products they can buy?
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cs__sec" aria-labelledby="s2">
  <p class="st-k rv">02 · Defining the experience</p>
  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s2">One studio, two tools</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    The approved scope set what the assistant had to do. I shaped it into one place, Apex AI Studio,
    holding two tools that share the same pattern: upload a photo, let the AI work, then shop the
    result.
  </p>
  <div class="st-stats st-wide rv">
    <div>
      <p class="st-stat">2</p>
      <p>AI tools in one assistant: AI Stylist and AI Colour Advisor</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="st-stat">6</p>
      <p>occasions to style for</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="st-stat">4</p>
      <p>steps from photo to purchase</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="st-grid st-g2 st-wide">
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Tool 01</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">AI Stylist</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">
        Upload a photo, choose an occasion, see yourself in a complete Apex outfit, then shop the
        whole look.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Tool 02</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">AI Colour Advisor</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">
        Upload a photo, get a personal colour profile, see which colours to wear and avoid, then
        shop products in your palette.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <h3 class="st-sub rv">What the scope asked of the customer experience</h3>
  <ol class="st-list st-wide rv">
    <li><strong>Built into the existing site</strong>One entry point on every supported page, with no separate app to learn.</li>
    <li><strong>Real products only</strong>Every recommendation comes from the Apex catalogue, with its price and details.</li>
    <li><strong>Clear while it works</strong>Progress while the AI generates, and a way to retry when it fails.</li>
    <li><strong>Straight to checkout</strong>A recommended outfit hands over to the existing Apex checkout.</li>
    <li><strong>Safe with photos</strong>Uploaded photos are encrypted, never shared and kept only as long as the retention policy allows.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="st-note rv">
    The full scope also covers internal tools, such as product tagging, moderation and analytics.
    This case study covers the customer-facing design, plus the prompt behind the product
    description generator.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="cs__sec" aria-labelledby="s3">
  <p class="st-k rv">03 · Key UX decisions</p>
  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s3">Five decisions that shape the studio</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    Follow the AI Stylist from start to finish first, then see each decision beside the screen it
    shaped.
  </p>

  <h3 class="st-sub rv">AI Stylist: from photo to outfit</h3>
  <div class="st-wide st-tabset--steady rv">
    <div class="st-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="AI Stylist steps">
      <button class="st-tab" type="button" role="tab" id="t-j1" aria-controls="p-j1">1. Open AI Studio</button>
      <button class="st-tab" type="button" role="tab" id="t-j2" aria-controls="p-j2">2. Upload a photo</button>
      <button class="st-tab" type="button" role="tab" id="t-j3" aria-controls="p-j3">3. Choose an occasion</button>
      <button class="st-tab" type="button" role="tab" id="t-j4" aria-controls="p-j4">4. Wait for the look</button>
      <button class="st-tab" type="button" role="tab" id="t-j5" aria-controls="p-j5">5. Shop the outfit</button>
