    <div class="st-gal" role="tabpanel" id="p-j1" aria-labelledby="t-j1">
      <p class="cs__p">From the Apex AI Studio button in the header, a product page, or the floating button on mobile.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="st-gal" role="tabpanel" id="p-j2" aria-labelledby="t-j2">
      <p class="cs__p">Drop a photo, browse for one or take one. The formats and the 10 MB limit are stated up front.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="st-gal" role="tabpanel" id="p-j3" aria-labelledby="t-j3">
      <p class="cs__p">Pick one of six occasions: Office, Wedding / Party, Field, Casual Outing, Travel or Campus.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="st-gal" role="tabpanel" id="p-j4" aria-labelledby="t-j4">
