      <div class="st-decision">
        <p class="st-k">Decision A</p>
        <h3 class="st-bh">Meet customers where they already shop</h3>
        <p class="cs__p">
          Customers should not have to look for the AI. An <strong>Apex AI Studio</strong> button
          sits in the main header, every product page offers “Try this look with Apex AI Studio”,
          and on mobile a floating button is always within reach.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="cs__fig rv">
      <img
