        <p class="st-k">Decision B</p>
        <h3 class="st-bh">Two tools, one familiar layout</h3>
        <p class="cs__p">
          AI Stylist and AI Colour Advisor sit as two tabs in the same panel. Each opens with a short
          promise and four numbered steps, so customers know what they will get before they share a
          photo.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="cs__fig rv">
      <img
        src="{{ '/assets/images/projects/apex-ai-studio-start.webp' | rel }}"
