<section class="cs__sec" aria-labelledby="s6">
  <p class="st-k rv">06 · AI Product Description Generator</p>
  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s6">Writing product copy in the Apex voice</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    The studio also includes an internal tool for the merchandising team. It turns a few product
    attributes into a ready-to-use description, so every product page reads with the same tone. The
    prompt behind it was tested on real Apex products.
  </p>
  <div class="st-callout rv">
    <p class="st-bh">
      “Write a product description in 100 words with 4 bullet point features of the following
      products. Keep the brand tone intact.”
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="st-grid st-g3 st-wide">
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Input</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">A short list of attributes</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">Product name, colour, type, materials and who it is for, written as plain keywords.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Output</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">About 100 words, 4 features</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">A short description to read, then four features to scan, in the same shape every time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Tone</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">One brand voice</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">Warm and practical copy that works into every attribute and leads with comfort and everyday use.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

