      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="st-note rv">
    The full tool, as scoped, takes Product Name, Colour, Gender, Season Type, Materials, Product
    Type and Product Category, checks required fields, and returns both a short and a detailed
    SEO-friendly description.
  </p>
</section>

